穿云 core muse.17: REALITY sends client version 26.10.21 in the session ID.
The first three plaintext session ID bytes are the client version; servers can
refuse versions below a configured (or release-default 26.3.27) minimum, and
the old 1.8.1 was below it. The version is one constant
(realityClientVersion in muse_reality_version.go).

